{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29140","headline":"赠河东虞押衙二首 一 · 许浑","name":"赠河东虞押衙二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长剑高歌换素衣，君恩未报不言归。\n旧精鸟篆谙书体，新授龙韬识战机。\n万里往来征马瘦，十年离别故人稀。\n生平志气何人见，空上西楼望落晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}